---
title: Website Ops Hub
---

<div class="hero mb-4">
  <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-lg-7">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-3">
        <span class="pill"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge"></i> Web & Technical Ops</span>
        <span class="pill"><i class="bi bi-git"></i> Git-based workflow</span>
        <span class="pill"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3"></i> Observable data flows</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="display-4 mb-3">Static site + integrations + automation</h1>
      <p class="lead muted mb-4">
        A demo that receives website leads, validates and stores them, and runs small integrations reliably.
        With visibility into what happened and why, because guessing is not an ops strategy.
      </p>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/contact.html">
          <i class="bi bi-send me-2"></i> Open contact form
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="/events.html">
          <i class="bi bi-activity me-2"></i> View live events
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4">
        <span class="badge badge-soft rounded-pill">Middleman</span>
        <span class="badge badge-soft rounded-pill">Bootstrap</span>
        <span class="badge badge-soft rounded-pill">TypeScript</span>
        <span class="badge badge-soft rounded-pill">Express</span>
        <span class="badge badge-soft rounded-pill">SQLite</span>
        <span class="badge badge-soft rounded-pill">Docker Compose</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-5">
      <div class="panel panel-strong p-4">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
          <div class="fw-semibold">Live status</div>
          <span id="healthBadge" class="badge text-bg-secondary rounded-pill">Checking…</span>
        </div>

        <hr class="soft my-3" />

        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="muted small">Latest events</div>
            <div class="fs-3 fw-bold" id="eventsCount">0</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-6">
            <div class="muted small">Last event</div>
            <div class="small" id="lastEventTime">n/a</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-3">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
            <div class="muted small">Event feed preview</div>

            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
              <button id="refreshEvents" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light">
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-1"></i> Refresh
              </button>

              <button id="clearEvents" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger" title="Clear events">
                <i class="bi bi-trash me-1"></i> Clear
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="eventsList"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="row g-3 mb-4">
  <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
    <div class="cardish">
      <div class="icon mb-3"><i class="bi bi-window"></i></div>
      <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">Website maintenance</div>
      <div class="muted">Code-driven static pages, clean structure, predictable builds.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
    <div class="cardish">
      <div class="icon mb-3"><i class="bi bi-plug"></i></div>
      <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">Integrations</div>
      <div class="muted">Forms → API → stored data → downstream systems, reliably.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
    <div class="cardish">
      <div class="icon mb-3"><i class="bi bi-gear"></i></div>
      <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">Automation</div>
      <div class="muted">Micro-integrations that reduce manual work and errors.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
    <div class="cardish">
      <div class="icon mb-3"><i class="bi bi-activity"></i></div>
      <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">Troubleshooting</div>
      <div class="muted">Events make data flows inspectable, not mystical.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel p-4">
  <div class="row g-4 align-items-start">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <h2 class="h4 fw-semibold mb-2">How it works</h2>
      <p class="muted mb-3">A simple pipeline, built like it matters.</p>

      <ul class="list-clean d-grid gap-2">
        <li class="event-row">
          <div>
            <div class="fw-semibold"><span class="badge badge-soft me-2">1</span> Submit the contact form</div>
            <div class="muted small">Browser sends JSON to <span class="badge badge-soft">/api/lead</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="muted small text-end"><i class="bi bi-send"></i></div>
        </li>
        <li class="event-row">
          <div>
            <div class="fw-semibold"><span class="badge badge-soft me-2">2</span> Validate + store</div>
            <div class="muted small">Zod validation, SQLite persistence, idempotency handling</div>
          </div>
          <div class="muted small text-end"><i class="bi bi-database"></i></div>
        </li>
        <li class="event-row">
          <div>
            <div class="fw-semibold"><span class="badge badge-soft me-2">3</span> Integrations</div>
            <div class="muted small">Mock CRM upsert + ops notification (structured as real steps)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="muted small text-end"><i class="bi bi-plug"></i></div>
        </li>
        <li class="event-row">
          <div>
            <div class="fw-semibold"><span class="badge badge-soft me-2">4</span> Observe everything</div>
            <div class="muted small">Events feed shows what happened and when</div>
          </div>
          <div class="muted small text-end"><i class="bi bi-activity"></i></div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <h2 class="h4 fw-semibold mb-2">Try it quickly</h2>

      <div class="kbd">
        docker compose up --build<br/>
        open http://localhost:3000<br/>
        submit the form → check /events
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/contact.html"><i class="bi bi-send me-2"></i>Contact</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-light" href="/events.html"><i class="bi bi-activity me-2"></i>Events</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
